# Converted from corpus/flowcharts/0027.mmd by corpus/convert.py.
User query -> Query understanding
PDF fixture -> Mixed-source corpus
Scanned OCR fixture -> Mixed-source corpus
Webpage fixture -> Mixed-source corpus
Table fixture -> Mixed-source corpus
Tool/API fixture -> Mixed-source corpus
Query understanding -> Mixed-source corpus
Mixed-source corpus -> Ingestion and normalization
Ingestion and normalization -> Local / production indexes
Local / production indexes -> Hierarchy Search
Hierarchy Search -> Evidence assembly
Evidence assembly -> LLM or deterministic answer step
LLM or deterministic answer step -> Verification and evaluation
Verification and evaluation -> Final answer with trace
